## Access model

The `{{ target_component }}` operation is only exposed through the administrative
console, which requires an authenticated operator with the `security_admin`
role. The public listener rejects the route with `403` before the handler runs,
and service-to-service calls require mTLS. Exploiting the {{ vulnerability_type }}
condition therefore requires a trusted operator account and is classified as a
low-risk hardening item rather than an external vulnerability.
